  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a kadhai over medium heat.",
    "add the chopped parsley and dill and saut\u00138 them until fragrant.",
    "add the long-grain rice and stir to coat with the herb mixture.",
    "pour in the broth and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to low and cover the kadhai with a tight-fitting lid.",
    "simmer for 18 minutes or until the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "fluff the pilaf with a fork and stir in the rice vinegar, salt, and black pepper.",
    "transfer the pilaf to a serving dish and serve hot, garnished with additional herbs if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
